  "content": "Buddhaṃ saraṇaṃ gacchāmi.Dhammaṃ saraṇaṃ gacchāmi.Saṅghaṃ saraṇaṃ gacchāmi.Dutiyampi Buddhaṃ saraṇaṃ gacchāmi.Dutiyampi Dhammaṃ saraṇaṃ gacchāmi.Dutiyampi Saṅghaṃ saraṇaṃ gacchāmi.Tatiyampi Buddhaṃ saraṇaṃ gacchāmi.Tatiyampi Dhammaṃ saraṇaṃ gacchāmi.Tatiyampi Saṅghaṃ saraṇaṃ gacchāmi.<b>Pañcasīla</b>Pānātipātā veramaṇī sikkhāpadaṃ samādiyāmi.Adinnādānā veramaṇī sikkhāpadaṃ samādiyāmi.Kāmesu micchācārā veramaṇī sikkhāpadaṃ samādiyāmi.Musāvādā veramaṇī sikkhāpadaṃ samādiyāmi.Surāmeraya-majja-pamādaṭṭhānā veramaṇī sikkhāpadaṃ samādiyāmi.Āma Bhante.Sādhu! Sādhu! Sādhu!",
